@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
hide footbox
title Fee statement: command routing and automatic-save checks

actor Tutor
participant "TutorLedger" as Main <<class>>
participant ":StorageCommands" as Persistence
participant ":PaymentCommands" as Commands

Tutor -> Main : fee_statement S1
activate Main
Main -> Persistence : snapshot()
activate Persistence
Persistence --> Main : before
deactivate Persistence
note right of Main
  PaymentCommands.handles(input) selects
  the payment command handler.
end note
Main -> Commands : execute(input)
activate Commands
ref over Commands : validate request and build statement
Commands --> Main : statement or error
deactivate Commands
Main --> Tutor : display statement or error
Main -> Persistence : saveIfChanged(before)
activate Persistence
note right of Persistence
  A fee statement changes no records.
  The snapshots match, so no file is written.
end note
Persistence --> Main : empty string
deactivate Persistence
deactivate Main
@enduml
